Package: CDEnrich
Title: Enrichment Analysis for Cell Death Pathways
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Yushan",
        family = "Chen",
        email = "chen_yushan0625@163.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides a curated collection of gene sets for major
    cell death modalities, including apoptosis, ferroptosis,
    pyroptosis, and disulfidptosis, with literature-supported
    representative gene sets recommended for 13 cell death types.
    Implements a unified workflow for over-representation analysis,
    gene set enrichment analysis (GSEA), and single-sample gene set
    enrichment analysis (ssGSEA), supporting both single-group and
    multi-group comparisons, differential analysis of pathway
    scores, and visualization. The package name 'CDEnrich' stands
    for Cell Death Enrichment Analysis.
